# Books permanently excluded from translation.
#
# One audiobook id OR ASIN per line; '#' starts a comment and the inline
# comment records WHY. Deployed to /etc/audiobooks/translation-exclude.txt.
#
# This list is deliberately external to translation_queue: a book merely
# marked 'failed' in the queue returns the moment anyone resets failed rows
# to pending. Entries here are retired to state='excluded' on every drain,
# so the exclusion survives that churn.
#
# Consulted by: scripts/batch-translate.py, scripts/verify-zh-corpus.py,
# scripts/sampler-reconcile.py (see library/localization/exclusions.py).

# 114213  # example: The Fyodor Dostoyevsky Complete Collection — 266 audio-hours
#         # whose final chapter marker spans 166 of them in one piece, producing
#         # a ~7 GB transcription upload. Operator decision 2026-09-13: out of
#         # scope permanently rather than build chapter subdivision for one book.
